# Three long tambourine shakes on the 2-voice snare track at P2 255: the third steals the first, which must fade out
# in a few milliseconds so the new hit starts at once; then soft and hard velocities.
tempo 120
steps 16
tail 6.0
track snare
param p2 255
note 0 70 1 127
note 1 70 1 127
note 2 70 1 127
param p2 128 8
note 8 53 1 20
note 10 53 1 64
note 12 53 1 127
expect sound 0 16
expect idle 110
expect peak_below -3
